'''Pawmot''' (Japanese: '''パーモット''' ''Parmot'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

